  "title": "Auditory naming",
  "description": "Intracranial EEG recordings from 106 patients performing an auditory descriptive naming task. Electrode coordinates are provided in MNI-305 space. The data support a dynamic causal tractography analysis of the networks underlying auditory naming.",
  "methods_description": "Intracranial EEG was recorded during an auditory naming task and stored as EDF files. Events are coded as stimulus onset (401), stimulus offset (402), and response onset (501). Electrode coordinates are in MNI-305 space.",
